---
interface Props {
  heroImage: string;
  heroAlt: string;
}

const { heroImage, heroAlt } = Astro.props;
---

<header class="hero">
  <div class="hero-grid" id="top">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">线上专题展 · 19世纪巴黎</p>
      <h2>光线照进<br />现代巴黎</h2>
      <p class="dek">从印象派看城市、社会与经济</p>
      <p>当街道变宽、火车加速、商业照亮夜晚，画家也开始寻找新的观看方式。</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-image">
      <img src={heroImage} alt={heroAlt} fetchpriority="high" />
      <figcaption>卡耶博特笔下的新巴黎：整齐、辽阔，也略显疏离。</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</header>
